{"gotravayavat‌": [{"id": "gotrAvayavAt‌", "headword": "गोत्रावयवात्‌", "headword_slp1": "gotrAvayavAt‌", "fold": "gotravayavat‌", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "After a word denoting a non-principal गोत्र , ष्यङ् is the substitute of अण् and इञ् , the feminine, even though the syllable preceding the final be not prosodially long.\n\nTerms: ष्यङ्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["गोत्रावयवात्‌ ४.१.७९", "४.१.७९", "४.१.७९ गोत्रावयवात्‌"], "synonyms_slp1": ["gotrAvayavAt‌ ४.१.७९", "४.१.७९", "४.१.७९ gotrAvayavAt‌"]}], "gotrelugaci": [{"id": "gotre'lugaci", "headword": "गोत्रेऽलुगचि", "headword_slp1": "gotre'lugaci", "fold": "gotrelugaci", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The लुक् elision of गोत्र (Patronymic) affixes in plural, which have been enjoined by sūtras यस्कादिभ्यो गोत्रे २.४.६३ etc. and the rest is prohibited, when the affix has an initial vowel and it has the sense of the various affixes taught antecedent to तेन दीव्यति खनति जयति जितम् ४.४.२.\n\nTerms: लुक्-गोत्र", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["गोत्रेऽलुगचि ४.१.८९", "४.१.८९", "४.१.८९ गोत्रेऽलुगचि"], "synonyms_slp1": ["gotre'lugaci ४.१.८९", "४.१.८९", "४.१.८९ gotre'lugaci"]}], "gotradyunyastriyam": [{"id": "gotrAdyUnyastriyAm", "headword": "गोत्राद्यून्यस्त्रियाम्", "headword_slp1": "gotrAdyUnyastriyAm", "fold": "gotradyunyastriyam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "When a descendant of the description denoted by युवन् -- जीवति तु वंश्ये युवा ४.१.१६३, is intended to be expressed, a new affix is attached, only after that what already ends with an affix marking a descendant as low at least as a grandson (गोत्र): but in the feminine the word is not termed युवन् and no new affix is added.\n\nTerms: गोत्र", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["गोत्राद्यून्यस्त्रियाम् ४.१.९४", "४.१.९४", "४.१.९४ गोत्राद्यून्यस्त्रियाम्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["gotrAdyUnyastriyAm ४.१.९४", "४.१.९४", "४.१.९४ gotrAdyUnyastriyAm"]}], "gotre kuYjadiByascPaY": [{"id": "gotre kuYjAdiByaScPaY", "headword": "गोत्रे कुञ्जादिभ्यश्च्फञ्", "headword_slp1": "gotre kuYjAdiByaScPaY", "fold": "gotre kuYjadiByascPaY", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix च्फञ् comes after the words कुञ्च etc. when a remoter descendant (called गोत्र) is to be denoted.\n\nTerms: च्फञ्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["गोत्रे कुञ्जादिभ्यश्च्फञ् ४.१.९८", "४.१.९८", "४.१.९८ गोत्रे कुञ्जादिभ्यश्च्फञ्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["gotre kuYjAdiByaScPaY ४.१.९८", "४.१.९८", "४.१.९८ gotre kuYjAdiByaScPaY"]}], "gotrastriyaH kutsane Ra ca": [{"id": "gotrastriyAH kutsane Ra ca", "headword": "गोत्रस्त्रियाः कुत्सने ण च", "headword_slp1": "gotrastriyAH kutsane Ra ca", "fold": "gotrastriyaH kutsane Ra ca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "And when contempt is to be expressed, the affix ण comes in the sense of descendant after a feminine word denoting a गोत्र-descendant.\n\nTerms: ण", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["गोत्रस्त्रियाः कुत्सने ण च ४.१.१४७", "४.१.१४७", "४.१.१४७ गोत्रस्त्रियाः कुत्सने ण च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["gotrastriyAH kutsane Ra ca ४.१.१४७", "४.१.१४७", "४.१.१४७ gotrastriyAH kutsane Ra ca"]}], "gotroksoswroraBrarajarajanyarajaputravatsamanusyajadvuY": [{"id": "gotrokzozwroraBrarAjarAjanyarAjaputravatsamanuzyAjAdvuY", "headword": "गोत्रोक्षोष्ट्रोरभ्रराजराजन्यराजपुत्रवत्समनुष्याजाद्वुञ्", "headword_slp1": "gotrokzozwroraBrarAjarAjanyarAjaputravatsamanuzyAjAdvuY", "fold": "gotroksoswroraBrarajarajanyarajaputravatsamanusyajadvuY", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix वुञ् comes the sense is 'a collection thereof' after a word denoting a गोत्र (Patronymic) and after 1. उक्ष 2. उष्ट्र 3. उरभ्र 4. राजन 5. राजन्य 6. राजपुत्र 7. वत्स 8. मनुष्य and 9. अज।\n\nTerms: वुञ्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["गोत्र